  "description": "Our Hook AL Sword all-road bike strikes a fine balance between light weight and simplicity. We selected the Microshift Sword groupset for its functionality and ease of servicing - sometimes a cable brake is all you need. But when we combined the wide range 11-48t cassette with the lightweight 6061-T6 hydro-formed aluminium frame, we unlocked mountain-mode and created a bike that flies up the ascents like an ibex. Completing this versatile package is a dose of futureproofing that comes with the UDH derailleur hanger.",
